   "notes": "Spalding Hostel (King's College), Peas Hill front north of Brewboard: four-storey grey-buff gault brick; ground floor two shopfronts (pasta/gelato shop with yellow awnings under a projecting cream cornice, then the dark ARK gift shop); a full-height canted bay at the south end and plain sashes elsewhere. Upper window positions north of the bay and the top storey are extrapolated from an oblique view. x from the south end."
